  "laptop_minutes": 1,
  "clipper_command": "sbatch bench/vdj/hpc/run.sbatch (per library), then bench/vdj/make_artifacts.py"
 },
 "caveats": [
  "Cell Ranger vdj was not run here (no licence accepted); its published outputs are the reference, so agreement metrics measure agreement with Cell Ranger, not with ground truth.",
  "pbmc5p_v1 and pbmc10k_5p_v2 are development data: the assembler's filters and fixes were made while comparing with their Cell Ranger contigs (and with GSE145370 S133A / S158A, which are therefore left out). The GSE145370 libraries scored here and the Chromium Controller set were downloaded after the code was frozen.",
  "Neither GENCODE nor RefSeq annotates IGHV1-8 and IGHV4-30-4 on GRCh38 (Cell Ranger and TRUST4 have them from IMGT): their rearrangements are not assembled or named, which costs BCR pairing and V agreement.",
  "MiXCR was not run: it needs a licence key."
 ]
}
